=== level_0 ===
# kind: level # level: 0 # title: Protocol Zero - The Virtual Forge # arc: act1_fracturing_grid # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
A wireframe grid simulation of Los Angeles skyline. Cyberpunk HUD elements glow against the digital abyss.

# kind: objective
Complete the combat and movement training protocol to achieve battle readiness.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
PROTOCOL ZERO: VIRTUAL FORGE SIMULATION. OPERATIVE STATUS: INITIALIZING.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Protocol Zero active. Operative linked. Cycle through movement, wall-jumps, and weapon systems to calibrate combat reflexes.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Simulated Xelthara Heavy Unit detected. Execute squad combination strike to confirm battle readiness.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Target destroyed. All systems nominal. Calibration 100% complete. Prepare for field deployment into active combat sectors.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
CALIBRATION COMPLETE. OPERATIVE CLEARED FOR FIELD DEPLOYMENT.

-> END

=== level_1 ===
# kind: level # level: 1 # title: Ghost in the Gridlock # arc: act1_fracturing_grid # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
The ruins of the Imperial Palace Gardens. Xelthara terraforming beams are dissolving stone monoliths into obsidian tax offices.

# kind: objective
Infiltrate the demolition site to retrieve the Data-Blade before the culture-erasure field purges human history forever.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Cyber Shogun # type: internal
They do not just take our land; they delete our soul. I will not let our ancestors be forgotten under their obsidian slabs.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 1: CULTURE-PURGE DEMOLITION SITE. OBJECTIVE: RETRIEVE THE DATA-BLADE.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Warning: Xelthara Culture-Erasure beams active. Memory purge at 42%. Data-Blade retrieval required.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Cyber Shogun # type: spoken
You call this demolition 'progress'? I call it a war on the human spirit. KATA: ANCESTRAL STRIKE!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Demolition field neutralized. Data-Blade secured. Xelthara Enforcer Legion deploying.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Cyber Shogun # type: spoken
If we cannot save the stone, we save the story. Secure the Data-Blade and move to Sector 2!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
MISSION COMPLETE: DATA-BLADE SECURED. THE PURGE WAS INTERRUPTED.

-> END

=== level_2 ===
# kind: level # level: 2 # title: The Concrete Wildfire # arc: act1_fracturing_grid # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
The gated checkpoints of Containment Zone 4. Biometric scanner spires power an energy wall separating families from the city.

# kind: objective
Hold the threshold against Xelthara Enforcer Walkers to protect escaping refugees and disable the biometric spires.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Aegis Ronin # type: internal
They put energy fences through our neighborhoods and herded us into camps. Today, we take our city back.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 2: CONTAINMENT ZONE CHECKPOINT. OBJECTIVE: DEFEND THE REFUGEES AND BREACH THE MEMBRANE.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Siege Units deploying heavy plasma mortars. Evacuation route at risk.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Aegis Ronin # type: spoken
As long as I draw breath, I am the wall between them and their containment camps. KINETIC OVERLOAD!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Oni Matrix # type: radio
Biometric spire overloaded! The energy wall is collapsing!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Aegis Ronin # type: spoken
The refugees are clear! Breach the checkpoint and push forward!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
MISSION COMPLETE: REFUGEES EVACUATED. CHECKPOINT DESTROYED.

-> END

=== level_3 ===
# kind: level # level: 3 # title: Neon Rust and Data Dust # arc: act1_fracturing_grid # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
Industrial scrap yards and transit depots powering Xelthara logistics.

# kind: objective
Hijack energy shipments and sabotage regional communication towers.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Virtual Guy # type: internal
Their comm-towers relay target vectors for every patrol in the sector. Time to blackout their eyes.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 3: TRANSIT & COMM DEPOT. OBJECTIVE: BLACKOUT OCCUPATION COMMS.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Comm-towers broadcasting denial of service. Trojan payload ready for injection.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Virtual Guy # type: spoken
Uploading virus into the relay grid. Comm-towers dark in three, two, one... clear!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Pink Man # type: spoken
Patrols are blind! Route to the Border Fortress is open!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
MISSION COMPLETE: COMM GRID BLACKED OUT.

-> END

=== level_4 ===
# kind: level # level: 4 # title: Shattered Aegis - Border Fortress Breach # arc: act1_fracturing_grid # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
The armored Border Defense Fortress guarding entry into the inner city.

# kind: objective
Defeat Border Commander Voss and breach the physical wall into the Downtown Core.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Aegis Ronin # type: internal
This wall has divided our city for five years. Today, it comes down.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 4: BORDER DEFENSE FORTRESS. OBJECTIVE: BREACH THE BORDER WALL.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Border Commander Voss deployed with heavy plasma turrets.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Border Commander Voss # type: spoken
Unregistered human insurgents! You will not step past this line!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Aegis Ronin # type: spoken
This line is human ground! SQUAD, BREAK THEIR SHIELDS!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Voss defeated. Fortress gates compromised. Wall collapsing!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
ACT I COMPLETE: BORDER WALL BREACHED. THE DOWNTOWN CORE IS OPEN.

-> END

=== level_5 ===
# kind: level # level: 5 # title: Shado-Grid Spire - Downtown Core # arc: act2_citadel_liberation # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
Neon-drenched corporate skyscraper district dominated by Xelthara surveillance spires.

# kind: objective
Infiltrate the surveillance spire and blackout the biometric tracking matrix.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Ninja Frog # type: internal
Shadows belong to the Resistance. Their cameras will see only ghost signatures.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 5: SURVEILLANCE SPIRE. OBJECTIVE: DISABLE THE BIOMETRIC TRACKING MATRIX.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Surveillance matrix tracking all citizen movements in Downtown Core.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Ninja Frog # type: spoken
Disabling main optical sensors. SHADOW DASH!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Surveillance spire dark. Citizen tracking offline.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
MISSION COMPLETE: SURVEILLANCE MATRIX OFFLINE.

-> END

