# kind: setting
Subterranean bio-gen laboratory beneath the city streets.

# kind: objective
Rescue captured resistance operatives and destroy the gene-warping pods.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Mask Dude # type: internal
No one gets left behind in their cages. Break the glass!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 6: BIO-GEN LABS. OBJECTIVE: FREE CAPTURED OPERATIVES.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Biological containment pods active. High-energy plasma locks detected.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Mask Dude # type: spoken
Smashing the pod locks! Get everyone to the evacuation shaft!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Operatives rescued. Facility self-destruct initiated.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
MISSION COMPLETE: OPERATIVES RESCUED. BIO-LAB DESTROYED.

