# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Reactor temperature rising. Coolant valves sealed.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Pink Man # type: spoken
Bypassing safety locks! Overload sequence engaged!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Reactor core critical. Citadel shield generator lost power.

