# kind: setting
High-altitude floating docks and VTOL gunship hangars.

# kind: objective
Disable the aerial patrol fleet and hijack a VTOL transport to storm the Citadel Spire.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Virtual Guy # type: internal
Their air supremacy ends right here on the landing pads.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 8: STRATOS DOCKS. OBJECTIVE: SECURE VTOL TRANSPORT.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
VTOL Gunships preparing for launch. Hangar doors locked.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Virtual Guy # type: spoken
