=== level_9 ===
# kind: level # level: 9 # title: Judgment Day - Citadel High Command # arc: act2_citadel_liberation # dialogue_status: scripted

# kind: setting
The central Xelthara High Command Citadel bridge overlooking Earth.

# kind: objective
Defeat Void Commander Xelthara, destroy the central command server, and liberate Earth.

# kind: solo_monologue # character: Cyber Shogun # type: internal
This is the final stand. The Citadel falls, or humanity fades into history.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: title_card
LEVEL 9: CITADEL HIGH COMMAND. OBJECTIVE: DEFEAT THE VOID COMMANDER. LIBERATE EARTH.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Void Commander detected on the high command bridge. Total squad integration required.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Void Commander # type: spoken
Insignificant indigenous life. Your resistance ends here!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Cyber Shogun # type: spoken
Earth is not your territory to rule! ALL CHAMPIONS, STRIKE TOGETHER!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: AXIOM-7 # type: vo
Void Commander neutralized. Citadel core critical. Occupation grid cascading offline.

# kind: dialogue # speaker: Aegis Ronin # type: spoken
The skies are clear. Earth belongs to humanity once more!

# kind: dialogue # speaker: DISPLAY # type: mission_complete
CAMPAIGN COMPLETE: THE CITADEL HAS FALLEN. EARTH IS LIBERATED!

